 "headline": "“Wacky Geniuses” - Los Angeles Magazine",
 "intro": "In collaboration with Beats By Dr Dre and Columbia Records, IHC created the first ever silent rodeo puppet experience to celebrate the release of Lil Nas X’s debut EP, 7.",
