   ],
   "html": "<p>Set at the iconic Bob Baker Marionette Theater in Los Angeles, the Beats Presents: Silent Rodeo Experience featured choreographed puppet shows for each track, five immersive photo moments, catered paninis, a performance from Lil Nas X (his second ever!) and a meet &amp; greet with his fans.</p>\n<p>The special event was part of Beats By Dre’s series \"Beats Presents\" which produces experiential happenings centered around the release of an artist’s new album. With Lil Nas X still establishing himself as an artist, the creative opportunities were wide open. The buzz was extremely high with celebrities like Chloe x Halle in attendance and coverage from NBC News.</p>"
  }
 ],
