  {
   "title": "Marionette show + custom puppets",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>IHC commissioned The Bob Baker Marionette Theater to craft a custom Lil Nas X marionette using an original mold and their classic technique to allow full range of motion for his boundary pushing dance moves. IHC worked alongside the theater to cast a variety of additional puppets, whimsical backdrops, and choreography to accompany each song off the EP for a full 25 minute show. Custom designed neon signs provided further immersive and stylistic touches.</p>"
    },
