   "title": "Live performance",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Framed as a \"silent rodeo,\" all audio for the event was transmitted into Beats By Dre headphones to generate a unique and brand centric experience. Following the marionette show, Lil Nas X surprised the audience with a lively yet intimate performance featuring “Old Town Road,” “Panini” and “C7losure (You Like).” The show even featured a guest appearance from a Miss Catty B for “Rodeo.”</p>"
