  {
   "title": "PHOTO MOMENTS",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Seven special photo moments allowed guests to insert themselves into backdrops from the widely popular “Old Time Road” music video as well as onto the album cover. Lil Nas X himself helped curate the ideas behind many as each was paired with a song off the EP itself. Guests roamed, took pics and posted, generating several million impressions.</p>"
